      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is more of a technical limitation. Having a lot of audio sources takes up CPU time and is bad for performance.\nOn PC the maximum is 64, on Quest it's 32 audio sources. Imagine a 16 person instance, with each player having an audio source - you'd already use up all 32 audio sources, and you'd run into issues if the world has any additional audio sources.\nPerhaps this will be possible in the future, with the next iteration of the Quest maybe?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
