      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name}: I like the idea, but I wonder if it might be possible to make a work around for this problem. Perhaps an option similar to \"Show Avatar\" that would allow players to disable all avatar sounds by default, then enable them only for specific players.",
