  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are so many avatars out there that are quest compatible and have sound but the quest users cannot hear this. One it is a bit of a disappointment as it completes some of the characters, 2 this can cause quest players to accidentally blast off the ears of pc users and get them blocked/ muted or even reported without them knowing why. It’s also a bit of a letdown and would be good to know why if it isn’t possible to add.",
